sequenceDiagram
  participant TDB as Product Template DB
  participant BUS as Event bus
  participant SUM as Summary pipeline
  participant IDX as Pending Update Index (in-region)
  participant UI as UI tier / user

  TDB->>BUS: TemplatePublished (publish_id, product, version, diff_ref)
  par parallel
    BUS->>SUM: generate/lookup summary (diff only)
    SUM->>IDX: (summary_key ready)
  and
    BUS->>IDX: fan-out rows for eligible engagements (from index, no loads)
  end
  UI->>IDX: list pending (reads index)
  UI->>BUS: DecisionRecorded (apply|decline, pins)
  BUS->>IDX: SM-3 apply / SM-4 decline
  TDB->>BUS: TemplateWithdrawn (withdraw_id)
  BUS->>IDX: supersede rows offering withdrawn version
  Note over TDB,BUS: hourly PublishHistorySnapshot for reconciliation
